WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.968 --> 00:00:01.801
-Guys, today is Friday and

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.534
that's usually when I catch up

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.200
on some personal stuff.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:03.868
I check my inbox,

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.100
return some emails,

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:05.901
and, of course, I send out

00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:06.801
thank you notes.

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:08.467
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.234
I was running a bit behind.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.133
I was wondering, can I write out
some thank you notes right now?

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:13.167
Is that okay with you guys?

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:14.200
[ Cheering and applause ]
I appreciate it.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:18.567
James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:20.000
[ Playing tender tune ]

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.200
♪♪

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.334
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:30.534
Thank you,
Daylight Savings this Sunday,

00:00:30.534 --> 00:00:32.400
for kicking off
that special half of the year

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.801
when our microwaves are actually
set to the right time.

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:35.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:38.267
-Hey, yeah!

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.467
-I knew it!
-Oh!

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:42.934
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.501
-Thank you, Apple,

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:46.367
for releasing a new
yellow iPhone

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:49.100
and basically saying, "Look,
there's only so many cameras

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.434
we can slap
on the back of this thing.

00:00:50.434 --> 00:00:51.534
[ Laughter and applause ]
I don't know.

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:52.267
It's yellow."

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:59.234
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:01.767
Thank you, au jus,

00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:04.434
for sounding like
a really fancy sneeze.

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:06.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:09.734
Au jus!

00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:11.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:13.634
-Gesundheit.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:14.400
Oui oui.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:17.567
Could you wee-wee
when you had your --

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:18.434
-No.
-No, you couldn't.

00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:20.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:21.667
-[ French accent ] No, no.
-That's probably why
it's painful.

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.901
-Well, it was weird
because it was European, so.
[You're a-peein']

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:25.834
[ Laughter ]
You know, French.

00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:32.367
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.367 --> 00:01:34.801
-Thank you, Korn and Toys"R"Us,

00:01:34.801 --> 00:01:36.934
for keeping the backward "R"
industry alive.

00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:40.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.501
Respect.

00:01:43.434 --> 00:01:44.634
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:48.367
Thank you, light blinking
on my Wi-Fi router,

00:01:48.367 --> 00:01:49.934
for either meaning
it's completely broken

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:51.167
or working perfectly.

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:53.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:53.601 --> 00:01:55.234
It's blinking.

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:55.901
That's a good thing.

00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:00.300
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.601
Thank you, Entenmann's,
for bringing back

00:02:02.601 --> 00:02:04.734
the see-through window
on your boxes...

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:05.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.067
...or, as doughnuts call you,

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:08.267
the red light district.

00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:10.100
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Mmm!

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.434
♪♪

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:14.767
-[ Baritone ]
Donut hole.

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:18.234
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:21.067
Thank you, finding the light
switch in the dark,

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:23.267
for letting me get
to third base with the wall.

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:24.667
[ Laughter and applause ]
There you have it, everybody.

00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:25.968
Those are my Thank You Notes.

